Datasets
--------

No dataset images are distributed in this repository. Only trained model
weights are provided, and model weights contain no original image pixels.

  Oxford 17 Flowers / Oxford 102 Flowers
    Nilsback, M.-E. and Zisserman, A.
    Visual Geometry Group, University of Oxford
    https://www.robots.ox.ac.uk/~vgg/data/flowers/
    No formal licence is published by the dataset authors; the images were
    acquired by web search and photography. Please cite:

      Nilsback, M.-E., & Zisserman, A. (2008). Automated flower classification
      over a large number of classes. In Sixth Indian Conference on Computer
      Vision, Graphics & Image Processing. https://doi.org/10.1109/ICVGIP.2008.47

  Private 100-class flower dataset
    Released by the organisers of the 7th National Collegiate Computer Contest
    (2025). Copyright remains with the contest organisers. This repository
    distributes only model weights trained on that dataset.


